comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-24T14:25:24.655Z",codex-root-agent,"Duplicate-check evidence: searched all statuses for CodeRabbit, literal Git pathspec, canonical migration scope, and merge-fence install recovery. Existing items own the original feature slices but are closed/released (except the separate performance regression pm-hcrmye); none owns this cross-cutting exact-head review remediation. PR thread IDs: PRRT_kwDORSgRDc6Tk2WL, PRRT_kwDORSgRDc6Tk2WQ, PRRT_kwDORSgRDc6Tk2Wg, PRRT_kwDORSgRDc6Tk2Wu, PRRT_kwDORSgRDc6Tk2W5, plus tracker-language thread PRRT_kwDORSgRDc6Tk2Vt."
  "2026-07-24T14:47:55.298Z",codex-root-agent,"Implementation evidence: exact-head review remediation now uses Git :(literal) pathspecs for both scans and shell-safe cleanup commands; bounds tracked-runtime diagnostic samples while preserving counts/remediation; makes fresh-init merge-fence failure recoverable only for typed PmCliError paths while propagating unexpected failures; converts inaccessible merge roots to typed merge_root_not_found SDK errors; and derives automatic schema-migration IDs from the canonical tracker realpath. Regression coverage includes bracket/apostrophe tracker roots, config-lock recovery, typed/unexpected init failures, inaccessible roots, bounded health details, and symlink/junction-stable migration identity. Local gates: focused 133-test suite passed; pnpm typecheck passed; pnpm lint/static quality/package boundary/token budget passed; docstring coverage 100/100/100; full sandbox coverage passed 355 files and 6,225 tests at statements 42,747/42,747, branches 30,329/30,329, functions 8,707/8,707, lines 41,549/41,549. Hosted exact-head CI and bot thread resolution remain before closure."
